NAME
     e2tools - look at and check an ext4 file system

SYNOPSIS
     dumpe2fs [-h] DEVICE
     tune2fs [-l] [-L LABEL] [-c N] [-i N] DEVICE
     fsck.ext4 [-f] [-n] [-y] DEVICE
     e2fsck ...
     resize2fs DEVICE [BLOCKS]

DESCRIPTION
     One program under five names. dumpe2fs prints the superblock and
     the group descriptors; tune2fs changes what can be changed after
     the fact; fsck.ext4 checks the file system and can repair it; and
     resize2fs grows or shrinks one.

SEE ALSO
     mkfs_ext4(8), mount(1), blkid(8)
